    "id": "9G5eqUx",
    "title": "Hoka Clifton 11 Running Shoes",
    "description": "Power every mile with the HOKA Clifton 11 Running Shoes, built for smooth, lightweight performance on daily runs and long distances alike. A breathable engineered mesh upper pairs with a plush CMEVA midsole and smooth MetaRocker geometry to deliver soft landings and effortless flow mile after mile. Finished with durable traction and a secure, locked-in fit, it’s designed to keep your runs fast, fluid, and unstoppable. What’s New: upper refresh with elevated engineered mesh upper and premium sockliner. Design: engineered mesh upper delivers breathable support for consistent airflow on daily runs. 3D printed touchpoints add lightweight structure and targeted durability. Reflective details for visibility. Double-lace lock system for secure fit. In-Shoe Comfort: Rearfoot-Focused Active Foot Frame cradles the heel for stability. Smooth MetaRocker promotes natural stride and seamless heel-to-toe transitions. Open cell sockliner provides soft step-in comfort with improved breathability. CMEVA midsole delivers lightweight cushioning for everyday mileage. Durability & Traction: Durabrasion rubber outsole offers reliable grip and long-lasting wear on road surfaces. Additional Details: Weight 9.87 oz / 280 g (size 10); Heel drop 8mm; Stack height 42mm heel / 34mm toe; Designed for road running and daily training; Vegan.",
